| `input_adb_lookup(lookupA.csv)`
| `input_adb_lookup(lookupB.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="lookupA.csv", "lookupA", source_lookup="lookupB.csv", "lookupB")
```### Create lookup specific fields for priority based coalesce ###```
| eval {source}_os = os
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, latest(_time) as _time, max(priority) as priority, min(risk) as risk, sum(score) as score__sum, count(score) as score__count, latest(owner) as owner, latest(lookupB_os) as lookupB_os, latest(lookupA_os) as lookupA_os by _key
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(priority) as priority, min(risk) as risk, sum(score__sum) as score__sum, sum(score__count) as score__count, latest(owner) as owner, latest(lookupB_os) as lookupB_os, latest(lookupA_os) as lookupA_os by _key
```### Calculate averages ###```
| eval score = score__sum / score__count
```### Define coalesce fields based on lookup priority ###```
| eval os = coalesce('lookupB_os', 'lookupA_os')
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, priority, risk, score, owner, os
| outputlookup assetdb
